      "parentWorkRefOrNull": "work.vexlife.interface-refinement.outcome",
      "label": "V4 — self-maintaining continuity rollover",
      "purpose": "Turn context pressure into graceful continuity rather than a sudden stop: form a compact working checkpoint from current intent/open loops/source refs and exact owner truth, optionally route already-accepted/consented semantic Memory through its rightful Score/Daily Memory owners, then start a fresh prompt/context lease from the newest checkpoint plus relevant Memory. Checkpoints supersede instead of recursively stacking summaries. Pressure-triggered checkpointing is not automatic semantic Memory promotion.",
